      <title>Arthas</title>
      <link>https://xialuohun.top/posts/java/arthas/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 11 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>xialuohun@gmail.com (夏洛魂)</author>
      <guid>https://xialuohun.top/posts/java/arthas/</guid>
      <category domain="https://xialuohun.top/categories/java/">Java</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;lightgallery&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; href=&#34;https://xialuohun.top/posts/java/arthas/images/arthas.png&#34; title=&#34;arthas&#34; data-thumbnail=&#34;/posts/java/arthas/images/arthas.png&#34; data-sub-html=&#34;&lt;h2&gt;arthas&lt;/h2&gt;&#34;&gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#39;https://xialuohun.top/posts/java/arthas/images/arthas.png&#39; alt=&#34;arthas&#34; height=&#34;105&#34; width=&#34;320&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Arthas是一款线上监控诊断产品,通过全局视角实时查看应用load、内存、gc、线程的状态信息,并能在不修改应用代码的情况下,对业务问题进行诊断,包括查看方法调用的出入参、异常,监测方法执行耗时,类加载信息等,大大提升线上问题排查效率.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item><item>
      <title>Jar包修改</title>
      <link>https://xialuohun.top/posts/java/jar%E5%8C%85%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 01 Oct 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>xialuohun@gmail.com (夏洛魂)</author>
      <guid>https://xialuohun.top/posts/java/jar%E5%8C%85%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9/</guid>
      <category domain="https://xialuohun.top/categories/java/">Java</category>
      <description>&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;将目标jar包拷贝到IDEA工程的lib目录下,然后右键lib目录,Add as Library.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;lightgallery&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; href=&#34;https://xialuohun.top/posts/java/jar%E5%8C%85%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9/images/BuildAsLib.png&#34; title=&#34;BuildAsLib&#34; data-thumbnail=&#34;/posts/java/jar%E5%8C%85%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9/images/BuildAsLib.png&#34; data-sub-html=&#34;&lt;h2&gt;BuildAsLib&lt;/h2&gt;&#34;&gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#39;https://xialuohun.top/posts/java/jar%E5%8C%85%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9/images/BuildAsLib.png&#39; alt=&#34;BuildAsLib&#34; height=&#34;755&#34; width=&#34;559&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol start=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;在IDEA中右键Src目录,新建一个Java类如下:&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;目标类: com.android.xxx.a.class&#xD;&#xA;新建类: com.android.xxx.a.java&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;ol start=&#34;3&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;用Jeb反编译目标class文件,拷贝到新建类中.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
